{"id":"pkg/router/metrics.go:(*routerMetrics).instrument","summary":"Watch requests are now counted in a per-group long-running gauge and are kept out of the in-flight gauge and the duration histogram. The histogram gains a verb label, which changes the exported series and any dashboards or alerts on them.","issues":[],"bucket":"human","change_kind":"behavior","headline":"Watches tracked in separate gauge; duration histogram gains verb label","confidence":0.8,"reason":"Changes the metric label schema and which requests are observed, and adds a defer-ordered gauge and log path for watches.","risk_signals":["metric label schema changed","request accounting changed","defer ordering"],"focus":["dashboards or alerts that use grafana_router_http_request_duration_seconds without the verb label","the access log still runs once per watch when it ends, including when the handler panics","longRunning label cardinality is bounded by the unknown-group label"]},
